msgctxt "help:product.cost.plan.operation_line,calculation:"
msgid ""
"Use Standard to multiply the amount of time by the number of units produced."
" Use Fixed to use the indicated time in the production without considering "
"the quantities produced. The latter is useful for a setup or cleaning "
"operation, for example."
msgstr "选择“标准”可将时间乘以生产数量。选择“固定”则使用指定生产时间，不考虑生产数量。后者适用于准备或清洁等工序。"

msgctxt "help:product.cost.plan.operation_line,quantity:"
msgid "Quantity of the production product processed by the specified time."
msgstr "在指定时间内处理的生产产品数量。"

msgctxt "help:product.cost.plan.operation_line,total_cost:"
msgid "The cost of this operation for total plan's quantity."
msgstr "此工序在计划总数量下的成本。"

msgctxt "help:product.cost.plan.operation_line,unit_cost:"
msgid "The cost of this operation for each unit of plan's product."
msgstr "每单位计划产品的此工序成本。"

